      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also here's a few other tickets recognizing the same issues with thumbnail size and cropping. \n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/make-thumbnail-resolution-and-layout-more-clear\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/how-avatars-and-world-thumbnails-are-viewed\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/thumbnail-cropping-guides",
      "viewerReactions": null,
